flowchart TD
  subgraph MEAS [What the app measures]
    direction TB
    A1[Model size and quantization]
    A2[Mixture of experts active path]
    A3[Your RAM and GPU memory]
    A4[Context length and KV cache type]
  end

  MEAS --> C[Estimate the memory needed<br/>and add safety headroom]
  C --> D{How much fits<br/>on the GPU?}
  D -- All layers --> E[Full GPU offload]
  D -- Some layers --> F[Mixed CPU and GPU]
  D -- Little or none --> G[Mostly CPU]
  E --> H[Runnability score<br/>shown before you download]
  F --> H
  G --> H
  H --> OPT[Optional: a small draft model<br/>MTP speeds up replies]
  OPT --> J{Runs out of<br/>memory on load?}
  J -- No --> N[Model loads and runs]
  J -- Yes --> K[Retry at a<br/>smaller context]
  K --> L{Still too big?}
  L -- No --> N
  L -- Yes --> P[Move the cache to RAM,<br/>then fall back to CPU]
  P --> N

  classDef accent fill:#14532d,stroke:#4ade80,color:#f0fdf4;
  class A1,A2,A3,A4 accent;
  classDef warn fill:#3b2f14,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#fef3c7;
  class K,P warn;
